# idb_companion scratch dirs. Facebook's iOS Development Bridge, reached through
# xcodebuildmcp / mobile-mcp (see opencode.json), creates these in the working
# directory on start and leaves them behind empty. Git ignores empty directories,
# so they never showed in `git status` and simply accumulated.
